<div class="min-h-[600px]">
    <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-gray-900 mb-4">
      CivicPatch is an open-source data pipeline and validation framework that enables continuous ingestion, 
      verification, and publishing of official government information. 
      </br>The initiative's design is modular, scalable, and intended to evolve into a global standard for 
      democratic transparency.
    </h3>
    <h5 class="text-gray-900 mb-4">
      CivicPatch is a project of the Civic Data Tech Alliance (CDTA). 
      CDTA is an open civic infrastructure initiative that builds a transparent,
      authoritative, and permanently free dataset of all U.S. jurisdictions, 
      elected officials, and candidates. 
      Its purpose is to restore public accountability 
      through clarity—no paywalls, no gatekeeping, no lost records.
    </h5>


    <p><a href="https://github.com/CivicPatch/civicpatch-tools" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline">CivicPatch Tools</a></p>
</div> 